cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ATRIUM translator: in-place machine translation of AMCR metadata fields and ALTO XML text, preserving document structure"
abstract: >-
  The translator translates the text inside an XML document and writes it back into the same document:
  every tag, namespace and attribute stays, and in an ALTO page every word box keeps its coordinates.
  It reads ALTO pages (the OCR text of scanned documents) and the free-text fields of AMČR metadata
  records, mainly Czech to English. Use it when the result must stay the same document in another
  language. It reads XML only, not plain text or PDF.
keywords:
  - "machine translation"
  - "ALTO XML"
  - "metadata translation"
  - "AMCR"
  - "cross-language discovery"
